// sacred-reverie — хардстайл in D minor, 148 BPM. Generated by MathMusic
// (style hardstyle, seed 3): dj intro → the story → build → climax → anti-climax → break → build II → final climax → dj outro.
// Themes: A — Euphoria Gate (врата эйфории) (as written), B — Skyfire (небесный огонь) (as written); the bridge melody is newly
// composed on the rhythm of a theme from kawaii. Computed parts: a screech riff on the roots in the anti-climax, a counter-melody from the chords, a run up to the dominant in every build-up, a reverse bass that rolls in the final, the theme at half speed in the outro.
// Euphoric hardstyle: the kick's tail and the reverse bass sit on the tonic and roll through the DJ intro, the climaxes,
// the anti-climax (a screech riff on the roots) and the outro; every part ducks under the kick, d(t) = 1 − 0.7(1 − t/0.18)²;
// the story is told in the breaks (piano, strings), the build-ups end on a reversed cymbal.
// It is an ordinary song file: change anything; the melodies can be drawn in the piano roll (P).
// x is time in beats; n counts semitones from C4 (MIDI 60).
